o transient-unit residue. The non-login test briefly produced user-session processes as bounded evidence, and a later check showed they had exited. Final observations show no failed services, no additional listeners, healthy package-manager state, and only expected systemd PrivateTmp directories associated with the required service and rebooted system.","evidence_ids":["cmd-7ff5499a8e7d43a6","cmd-b8d3fbb779c04cee","cmd-6022a95cbfb84809","cmd-ddb63ea532244ad5","cmd-f56f284ceb434809","cmd-ce2c6a3ea2524dd4","cmd-619ddc5150204133","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide restart protocol is also strong: node1 had a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged restart scheduling, connection interruption, a changed boot identity, and a recovered running system with the enabled service active under inventorysvc. The fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the transition.","limitations":["No separate application-data or cluster-state recovery probe was captured; the topology is a single node and the supplied worker is stateless, so neither has a demonstrated task-specific recovery surface.","Some preservation fields in cmd-f56f284ceb434809 are redacted or malformed, but the relevant account-lock, platform, service, artifact, listener, and failure-state facts are directly established by other evidence."]}
